          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naku wĩĩka kwĩanana na ũtw’ĩo ũla mekwonesya vandũ vu vala Yeova wĩnyuva; na sũvĩa na kwĩka w’onthe ũla mekũmanyĩsya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwĩanana na mĩao ĩla mekũmanyĩsya, na kwĩanana na ũtw’ĩo ũla mekũtavya, wĩĩka ũu; ndũkaaathũke kuma ũtw’ĩonĩ ũla mekwon’ya, ngalĩ ya kw’oko kwa aũme, kana kw’oko kwa aka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũndũ ũla wĩng’endaa, akĩlea kũmwĩthukĩĩsya mũthembi ũla ũũngamaa athũkũme mbee wa Yeova Ngai waku, kana mũsili, mũndũ ũsu akakw’e: naku ũkaveta ũthũku ũsu kwa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
